version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-01"
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - AI safety
  - runtime compliance
  - team governance
  - emergent behavior
  - audit trail
abstract: >-
  A2ASTC is a runtime compliance layer for multi-agent AI systems.
  It treats the emergent team formed when agents exchange messages
  as a first-class governed entity, detecting team formation,
  auditing emergent behavior across five signal families, enforcing
  graduated compliance verdicts, and maintaining a tamper-evident
  hash-chained audit trail.
